+<sup>12</sup>bcftools view arguments used to filter SNVs before VEP annotation; must include the `--exclude`/`--include` flag itself. Set to an empty string to disable filtering. Set stricter filters to reduce the number of variants processed downstream. Default: `--exclude "INFO/GNOMADAF > 0.70 | INFO/GNOMADAF_grpmax > 0.70"`. The default assumes gnomAD v4 labelling (`GNOMADAF_grpmax`); if your annotation resources still use the gnomAD v2/v3 `GNOMADAF_popmax` field, override this parameter accordingly, otherwise bcftools will error on the undefined `GNOMADAF_grpmax` tag.<br />
 
 :::note
